    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d700">

                <pb facs="0731" n="719" sameAs="frus:frus1945v08/pg719"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Truman Papers</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the British Prime Minister</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Attlee</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to President Truman
                    </hi><anchor n="11" xml:id="d700-f1"/>
                </head>
                <p>I have read your memorandum of July 24 about Palestine. You will I am sure
                    understand that I cannot give you any statement on policy until we have had time
                    to consider the matter, and this is simply to inform you that we will give early
                    and careful consideration to your memorandum.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C. R. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Attlee</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-07-31">31 July, 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
